# Android 12 Treble migration: the legacy install_recovery domain is no longer
# defined for vendor policy. AOSP now assigns the generated
# /vendor/bin/install-recovery.sh to vendor_install_recovery and already grants
# that domain the boot/recovery block-device access required by applypatch.
# cappu has no separate init service or file_contexts entry for the old domain,
# so its obsolete generic sysfs, MTD, TEE, and partition grants are intentionally
# not carried forward as extra vendor permissions.
